---
title: Schedule Orders
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Worker
    participant MES
    box Adaptive Scheduler
        participant App
        participant Core
    end
    participant Nest as Nesting
    Worker ->> MES: finishes task
    MES ->> App: send planning horizon, graphs and states
    activate App
    App ->> App: Validate graphs
    alt graphs wrong
        App -->> MES: Graphs did not pass Validation
    end 
    App ->>+ Core: send planning horizon and graphs
    Core ->> Core: resolve graphs
    Core -->>- App: propose feasible schedule
    App ->> App: validate schedule and resolve ids
    App ->> App: evaluate schedule
    App ->>+ Nest: propose order and batches
    Nest -->>- App: propose batches
    alt different batches
        App ->>+ Core: send proposed batches
        Core ->> Core: resolve graphs
        Core -->>- App: propose feasible schedule
        App ->> App: validate schedule and resolve ids    
    end
    App -->> MES: return schedule
    MES -->> Worker: notify for new plan
    deactivate App
